	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Postremas illas tuas, quibus inclusae erant alterae ad <persName ref="p8354">Georgium Laetum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scriptę, matura accepi neque non, quam diligenter potui, perferendas illas <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad <persName ref="p8354">Laetum</persName> curavi, ut iusseras.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Putavi quidem adhuc Augustae agere; <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sed tua inscriptione certior factus, animadverti migrasse hominem, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quem tamen non dubito tuas iam nunc accepisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>De <placeName>Pannonicis</placeName> rebus aliud non accipimus, quam quod arces quasdam cum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>oppidulis paucis munierit impositis praesidiis <persName ref="p18477">rex Ferdinandus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ea <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>res argumento est, parum ipsum fidere <placeName ref="l2510">Turcae</placeName>, etiamsi rumor quaedam attule<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>rat de induciis annorum aliquot cum <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> pactis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Certum autem est, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>etiam <placeName>Panoniam</placeName> illam, quae Christianismum profitetur quaeque in manu <placeName ref="l2510">Turcae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non est, de evangelio recipiendo vale sollicitam esse, quemad<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>modum et <placeName ref="l2472">Sarmatiam</placeName>, quantumvis episcopi quidam refragentur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>In <placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> <persName>Carolum</persName> proscriptionem aedidisse et multis in locis imperii <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>publicasse, certo ferunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quod si quid veri rumor ille habet, bre<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vi resciscam et omni de re te certiorem efficiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Nostri crebris amicorum literis et variis quidem e locis admonentur, ut rebus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>suis invigilent et sibi caveant a repentinis eruptionibus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Und sol endtlich <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>erfaren und warhafft sein, das der <persName ref="p18538">kayser Carolus</persName> vorhabe, ain <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>aydgnoschafft mit dermaßen verfaßter und gwaltiger rüstung anz<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>elauffen und ze umhalben, das wir dess schwaren jochs allerlay tiranne<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>yen kaum werdind ledig sein; man begebe sich dan auf ettliche mittel, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>dieselbigen anzenemen und ze halten etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Und wil nur die sag sein, <placeName ref="l28">Ba<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sel</placeName> habe ainen haimlichen verstand mit dem kayser, das mir doch gar nit <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>glouplich ist.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Item söllind sy sich absolute begeben haben, was in nachst<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>künftigem concilio beschlossen werde, wellind sy one widerred annemen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">At vero <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>diversum illos sentire, literae mihi tuae demonstrant.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName>, 16. <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Ianuarii, anno 15<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>49.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><placeName ref="l28">Basiliensium</placeName> responsum ad pagos et vestrum contraque quid de ipsis <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>utrimque sibi velint polliceri, fac, oro, fido aliquo nuncio accipiam.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Rem gratissimam feceris senatui nostro, si de iis omnibus bona fi<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>de me admonueris; nos contra pro mutua fide et salute tibi <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>concredemus omnia.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Vellem autem et collegii tui consilium <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>de habendo concilio et quatenus parendum sit concilio etc. <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ad me, ut es pollicitus, mitteres; hoc ipsum enim et ministri nostri desiderant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Nihil autem dubita, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>quin omnia haec nobis solis communicari petamus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo viro D. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Bullingero</persName>, episcopo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, domino suo et amico longe amantissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
